l99: $ G , xx4 = ⟨ kc_ind_rec , scons td (scons ti (scons tv ∅)) ⟩ , xx5 = ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , scons td (scons ti (scons tc ∅)) ⟩ , xx6 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , ra_add tnp tn xx0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine xx4 te2 xx0 ∈ lrel , ra_add xx0 tm xx1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine xx4 te3 xx1 ∈ lrel , ra_add xx1 tni xx2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine xx4 te4 xx2 ∈ lrel , ra_add tnp tnf xx3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine xx5 tmj xx3 ∈ lrel , ra_isort tF tni l ∈ lrel , ra_ind_data td b p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p x1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys t n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives td x1 tv ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors td x1 n ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty t ti h c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor c tc x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minor_idx t ti tc k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis x5 f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add f m a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x2 ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rwalk td x1 n m tv f ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x6 x5 v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lams x4 v x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lams x3 x7 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lams p x8 tR ∈ lrel ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
