l94: $ G , tT = ⟨ kc_app , scons z (scons tmj ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_ind_arity td x1 n m ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx td ti k ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x1 k l ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons td (scons ti ∅) ⟩ tB l ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add m n x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add tnf m a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add a n d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_rec , scons td (scons ti (scons tv ∅)) ⟩ d x1 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs e a n f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs f tnf m te3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons td (scons ti ∅) ⟩ d x1 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x2 tnf tB t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead y te3 k t te4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , scons td (scons ti (scons tc ∅)) ⟩ d x1 tc1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs tc1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ tnf tmj ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons ti ∅ ⟩ n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add a x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead y ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ k t z ∈ lrel ⇒ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , scons te4 (scons tmj ∅) ⟩ w r = dt u (mcv H) trhs w r ∧ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , scons te4 (scons tmj ∅) ⟩ w r ∈ dt u (mcv H) tT w r $ by and_intro [and_elim_l [l88], wcel_eq_r [l93, and_elim_r [l88]]]
l95: $ G ⇒ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , scons te4 (scons tmj ∅) ⟩ w r = dt u (mcv H) trhs w r ∧ dt u (mcv H) ⟨ kc_app , scons te4 (scons tmj ∅) ⟩ w r ∈ dt u (mcv H) tT w r $ by fci_inv_iota_lhs [l1, l94]

