lemma fci_inv_iota_tel {qb_v qP qT qnp qn_v qm_v qmn qM qN qXl qQ qQ1 qQ2 qF qK qK2 qC: set} (G H: hyps) (Cf: fml) (t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8: set): $ G ⇒ ra_iota_tel t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ∈ lrel $ > $ H , ra_ind_data t1 qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives t1 qnp t2 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors t1 qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT t3 qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC t4 qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK t7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst t1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis t5 t6 qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen t5 t7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp t5 qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn t5 qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 t8 ∈ lrel ⇒ Cf $ > $ G , H ⇒ Cf $
----
l1: $ G , H ⇒ ra_iota_tel t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G , H ⇒ ∃ x ∃ qb_v ∃ qP ∃ qT ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ qnp ∃ qn_v ∃ qm_v ∃ qmn ∃ v ∃ qM ∃ qN ∃ w ∃ qXl ∃ qQ ∃ qQ1 ∃ qQ2 ∃ a ∃ qF ∃ qK ∃ qK2 ∃ b ∃ qC (t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_iota_tel_cases [l1]
l3: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel $ by ax
l4: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ qb_v = qb_v $ by eq_refl
l5: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ qP = qP $ by eq_refl
l6: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ qT = qT $ by eq_refl
l7: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_ind_data t1 qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [ra_ind_data_eq [eq_sym [and_elim_l [l3]], l4, l5, l6], and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [l3]]]]]]]]]]
l8: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ qnp = qnp $ by eq_refl
l9: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by eq_refl
l10: $ G , H , t1 = x ∧ t2 = y ∧ t3 = z ∧ t4 = u ∧ t5 = w ∧ t6 = b ∧ t7 = v ∧ t8 = a ∧ ra_ind_data x qb_v qP qT ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen qP qnp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ntys qT qn_v qm_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_motives x qnp y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qM ∈ lrel ∧ ra_minors x qnp qn_v ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qT qN ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty qT z qF qC ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ctor qC u qK ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis qK v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ qn_v qnp qK qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed qnp qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis w b qK2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen w v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp w qP qQ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add qm_v qn_v qmn ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clift qmn w qXl ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qM qP qQ1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qN qQ1 qQ2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp qXl qQ2 a ∈ lrel ⇒ qM = qM $ by eq_refl
